	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r03r0101_middlewoman2_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>だれかを　そだてるのではなく
だれかが　そだつのを　てつだう……▼
それが　わたしや　となりの
そだてやふうふの　のぞみ　なの</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T08:20:57" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>だれかを　育てるのではなく
だれかが　育つのを　手伝う……▼
それが　園長である　私や
隣の　育て屋夫婦の　望みなの</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T08:21:19" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
※swanでメッセージ修正</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T08:17:36" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>MIDDLEWOMAN2
太ったおばさん</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
